%% One conversation turn — overview
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant B as API
    participant A as Agent
    participant RS as Redis · short-term<br/>(chat history)
    participant RL as Redis · long-term<br/>(cross-session memory)

    C->>B: POST /threads/{id}/stream
    B->>RS: Load chat history
    B->>A: Run the agent
    A->>RL: Recall relevant memories
    loop reasons & uses tools
        A-->>C: Server-Sent Events (SSE) stream
    end
    A->>RS: Append to chat history
    A->>RL: Save memories (preferences,<br/>solved problems, artifacts)
    Note over C: Reply streams in live,<br/>and is there when you return
